    "latest_update": "R-156 differentiates chi(A,B)=(A xi_p,B(xi_2p+A xi_p)) and separates the intrinsic physical-source Hessian from controller connection curvature. The exact normalized graph-rotation audit reduces a numerical radius to one scalar inequality involving the registered 47/1000 headroom, U_*=||(H_pi(0)-I/10)|_E||, and a pinned third-variation modulus L_*(R). Those constants and the finite production cylinder are not fixed, so the numerical radius is parked without a new theorem. No intrinsic counterexample was found. Separately, R-157 eliminates every nonzero equilibrium of pinned unconstrained M1. R-158 proves exact finite-shell first-order coexistence only after imposing fixed charge or chemical potential; it also proves that the state remains above the neutral zero reference and carries only common-phase winding in registered local observables. This advances PA-M1-Q conditionally without selecting a physical vacuum or changing T-050.",
    "success_condition": "Preserve R-151--R-156. On the direct branch, pin the smallest actual finite production cylinder, compute U_* and L_*(R) by exact Wick/interval methods, solve the registered sufficient-radius inequality, and sweep cutoff/floor dependence; alternatively produce a genuine intrinsic counterexample. Do not add another qualitative chart or invented low lemma. On the truth-first branch, preserve R-157 as the pinned unconstrained M1 rejection and R-158 as the solved but physically unproven PA-M1-Q ensemble mechanism. Formalize PA-M5-NL3-SV, apply its exact zero-reference and causal-shell falsifiers, freeze the evidence/candidate discriminator matrix, and apply T-053 only to survivors. T-050 must still close before OVERLAP_src, Nelson, removals, the interacting measure, or Sector-A closure."
